#. それにしてもよぉ…
#. 希望ヶ峰学園がこんな辛気くせぇ場所だとはなぁ…
msgctxt "0001 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"God, I had no idea this Hope's Peak Academy place was\n"
"gonna be such a pain in my balls."
msgstr ""

#. どっちかっつーと、俺のいた鑑別所みてーだ。
#. いや、それよりヒデーかもな…
msgctxt "0002 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"It really ain't that much different from the time I\n"
"spent in juvie. Hell, this place is even worse!"
msgstr ""

#. それに…どうして誰もいないんですかね？
#. 今だって校内を歩いてても、誰とも会わなかったし…
msgctxt "0003 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"And why isn't there anyone here? Walking through the\n"
"halls, I didn't see a single person..."
msgstr ""

#. なんだかさ…マジでヤバいんじゃない？
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Isn't that like, seriously not good?"
msgstr ""

#. ぼ、僕らを驚かせようとしてるだけだろう！
#. あの鉄板だって後で外してくれるに違いない…
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Th-They're just trying to spook us! They'll take those\n"
"metal plates down later, I'm sure of it..."
msgstr ""

#. どちらにせよ、腹をくくる他あるまい。
#. 虎穴に入らずんば虎児を得ず…だ。
msgctxt "0006 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"All we can do now is hope for the best and prepare for\n"
"the worst. Nothing ventured, nothing gained."
msgstr ""

#. 別にビビってる訳じゃねーんだ…
#. 行ってやろうじゃねぇか…！
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Well hell, it ain't like I'm scared or nothin'. Let's\n"
"just get this over with!"
msgstr ""

#. オラァ！　俺様を呼び出しやがったのは、
#. どこのどいつだぁ！！
msgctxt "0008 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey! Where's whoever called us here!?"
msgstr ""

#. おい、大和田くんッ！　校内を走ってはいけないぞ！
msgctxt "0009 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Mondo, stop! No running!"
msgstr ""

#. では、我も行くとしよう…
msgctxt "0010 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I too shall go."
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、待って！　１人にしないでッ！！
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "H-Hey, wait! Don't leave me here all alone!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>はい、<CLT><CLT 3>チュートリアル<CLT><CLT 23>でごさいます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Okay, time for some more <CLT><CLT 3>tutorial<CLT><CLT 23> action!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>部屋の中では、<CLT><CLT 3>%CTRL_OBSERVING_EYE%<CLT><CLT 23>で、
#. 周囲を<CLT><CLT 3>観察<CLT><CLT 23>する事が可能でございます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You can press the <CLT><CLT 3>%CTRL_OBSERVING_EYE%<CLT><CLT 23> to <CLT><CLT 3>observe<CLT><CLT 23> the room\n"
"you're in.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>観察<CLT><CLT 23>によって、調査対象を簡単に発見できます。
#. ご連絡が遅れまして、申し訳ございません。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>Observing<CLT><CLT 23> will display what people and objects you\n"
"can interact with. Sorry for the late notice!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 他の生徒さん達はどこに行ったんですかね…？
#. どうして、私達しかいないんですかね…？
msgctxt "0015 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Where are all the other students? Why are we the only\n"
"ones here?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>無言…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Total silence...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は…なんだか１人だけ冷静のような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For whatever reason, she's the only one managing to\n"
"stay calm.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…気のせいか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or maybe I'm just imagining that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…ヤバげな雰囲気なんですけど…
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "I'm totally getting a bad vibe right now."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園、ずいぶんテレビが多いな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This school has a lot of TVs.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっきの変な校内放送のためじゃないよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They couldn't all just be for that weird school\n"
"broadcast, could they?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにも監視カメラ…
#. 常に見られているようで落ち着かないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Another surveillance camera. I feel like we're being\n"
"watched every second. I don't like it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これはショーウインドウかな？
#. トロフィーやら楯やらが飾られている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A display case... There are all kinds of trophies and\n"
"plaques inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園に集まってくる生徒は、
#. 超高校級の人ばかりだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Of course, all the students who go here are ultimate,\n"
"right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これはほんの一部なんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So this is probably just a tiny fraction of all their\n"
"awards.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>体育館に行かなきゃな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better head to the gym.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
